// Bounded proof-carrying shift-robust risk transport D11.
//
// Public records are observations or refusals and carry no authority. Positive
// evidence and warrant states are module-private frozen-fixture tokens. The
// only state path preserves the source canary rank or moves downward. Ordinary
// Sounio values remain copyable, so the trace proves neither affine use nor a
// live institutional revocation mechanism.

use epistemic::proof_carrying_deployment_validity_revocable_authority::{
    observe_d10_fixture_canary_lease,
    replay_d10_complete_fixture_canary,
}

